@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071
@token = replace-with-login-token

### Team page navigation: the teams I follow (database ids)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nav/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Associations that own a followed team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nav/associations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Divisions of that association that own a followed team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nav/associations/1/divisions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leagues of that division that own a followed team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nav/divisions/1/leagues
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Followed teams of that league
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/nav/leagues/1/teams
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail of a followed team, keyed on teams.id (the schedule is resolved server-side)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail keyed on Spordle ids (chat card / agent output)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leagues/194908/teams/181303
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Unknown team
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/leagues/194908/teams/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}